#### 4.2.3 J/\(\psi\) Detection Efficiency

In the two previous sections we assessed the inefficiencies associated with \(dE/dx\)-related quantities, which were not properly accounted for in the simulations. These were incorporated into the rest of the embedding analysis by folding their

