* Time of Flight patch detector based on multi-gap resistive plate chamber technology, located at the five o'clock position in the east portion of STAR.
* Time Projection Chamber. The TPC is STAR's main tracking detector.
* Time Projection Chamber Tracker. TPT is the current track finding software package for the STAR TPC.
* Time Projection Chamber Response Simulator. TRS is the software package that simulates the full detector response to charged particles.

